                <pb facs="0431" n="351" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg351"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Squiers to Mr.
                            Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-06-10"><hi rendition="#italic">June 10,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Amnesty has been granted by Cuban Government crimes committed American citizens
                    during intervention period.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Squiers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
